  <item>
    <title>每月涨5万粉丝的储能界新星：储能热榜创始人澹总起家史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670234666c7f8177860a3bfb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670234666c7f8177860a3bfb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Oct 2024 06:55:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一个自媒体博主分享了他在新能源储能行业的奋斗故事，从初期的发展，到行业内的竞争，他是如何通过自媒体推动产业链融合的。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2I1MjMtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy9ENS82RS9HS3dSSVVFSzFfV2hBQUJ1ZEFNYWExZkMucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>储能界的小旋风 “储能热榜” 带你赚钱有妙招！从自学成才的自媒体新秀，到储能热榜的掌舵人，澹总如何跨界玩转新能源？他的储能展直播爆棚，微信群聊人气冲天，连征婚都别具一格！但背后却是行业苦乐交织的真实写照：价格战、利润薄，储能热却遇冷思考。资本市场冷静期，他却逆流而上，用媒体之力撬动产业链。想知道储能行业的台前幕后？快来听听这段边爬山边访谈的播客，带你近距离感受澹总的储能世界。是跟风还是真英雄？答案就在这一期节目中。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务微信ID：cangzheli</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 播客访谈：新能源领域的自媒体博主分享储能行业见解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 储能产业展会频发，利润增长困境如何突破？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a> 储能行业的冷静期：资本市场的限制与产业周期的调整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 个人创业者的成功之道：自媒体与储能市场的融合之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> 转型自媒体，分享产业洞察与心得，他的故事令人钦佩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a> 探索市场边界：选择一个小市场的优势与挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> 电网的重要性和谷电充电的效益：工业用电的节能策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2099">34:59</a> 新能源储能：探索除车水蓄能以外的储能形式。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2398">39:58</a> 如何通过阅读和整理获得优势人脉和知识财富？方法论分享！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a> 知识博主的海洋：如何找到适合自己的学习方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2999">49:59</a> 真实的反馈与内耗：打造长期主义的合作精神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3298">54:58</a> 命运的安排：从端盘子到自媒体，一位大叔的不凡人生之旅</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzgwMGItYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy82My9FNS9HQXFoTUEwSzFfV09BQVA5Q0FNYWEwNHUuanBnIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p>]]></description>
