    <title>双碳融资一哥￤绿水青山那点事儿和真金白银的路子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663f8ec4b813c7172b701c7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663f8ec4b813c7172b701c7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 May 2024 15:29:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本次播客由</span><strong><span>金融一哥【郑晓光】</span></strong><span>大总监赞助播出！</span></p><span></span><p><span>很荣幸在小宇宙上认识一位播客搭子--郑总。微信在后。郑总深耕金融15年，对企业现金流专业解决问题。有时候要化身侦探、又有时看五大行的动作对企业坚决Say No的部门。来看看郑总看双碳领域的企业遇到哪些趣事儿吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>后面小师太也给郑总赠送"电视剧"版的销售绝招！请大家笑着听哦~</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>商务微信：cangzheli</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>郑总播客：鳄鱼在说话</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 笑嘻嘻地了解一下三虎金融郑总</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 郑总和小师太的播客奇缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 郑总从金融融资投资转型到双碳领域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 郑总看温铁军后的影响和感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 绿水青山那点事儿和真金白银的引子由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 几大行拨款到双碳但是除了光伏的原因,和郑总也不碰的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 郑总与储能配资的经历和趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> 24年提出光伏为什么是一个好资产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 郑总金融业务的解决问题客户的画像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 叫郑总不如叫“侦探”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1989">33:09</a> 郑总找客户的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 从来不怕电销的小师太不要脸的销售方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 双碳行业里难居间或者难搞的客户</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">45:07</a> "技术迷"客户、数学型客户、强势型客户怎么合作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3058">50:58</a> 郑总给双碳金融的小白的建议</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl0CJD0cwUdaOYIHqp6h4SoWIiHk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_xOjM-FbNYdEAscgn3OWQQSu5I.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
