  <item>
    <title>年薪300万到亿级财富启示￤阿里互联网人转型光伏储能如何守金矿？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6632383603bcdd73a9096893</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6632383603bcdd73a9096893</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 May 2024 12:40:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>【本期嘉宾】-- Noodle</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>Noodle 是一位阿里15年互联网人，年薪百万，思维惊人地活跃，解决问题的方式永远10+种以上。在他的世界里，赚钱已经不是难题，而是他愿不愿意正眼看一下而已。</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;本期播客在采访过程中有些严肃，他容易讲完话题自我总结，这仅是他智慧的1%的体现。播客录完后，Noodle对我的播客提上了要求和上帝视角看小师太自己，又一次被大佬的思维折服。抱歉，今天只能严肃的听大佬讲商业了。</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>商务微信：cangzheli</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> Noodle百万年薪后躬身入局到光伏投资行业</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> Noodle自我总结</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 为什么一定是光伏为开始，而不是新能源车或其他？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> 怎么凝聚自己小微团队？怎么做到大家都是全神贯注打造高能力的？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> Noodle自我总结</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> 从Noodle精神学到“学习型转换成独当一面”的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> Noodle认可的小师太是什么样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> Noodle自我总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 半年20兆瓦的开发逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> 对光伏投资金融、风险的经历和理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a> 对居间人、同行的信息勾兑的管理判断有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> Noodle自我总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a> 对施工单位EPC的管理，提高自己的投资回报率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> Noodle对小师太的影响、对电力政策的新理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> Noodle自我总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 俩人对“政策”本质的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> Noodle对储能的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a> Noodle自我总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2740">45:40</a> Noodle对未来电力的理想规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2834">47:14</a> Noodle对新入局的小白的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2953">49:13</a> Noodle一个月链接200个客户+“夜总会”的生活态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 小师太片面的认为新能源人都没有太多“时间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">52:28</a> Noodle的广告位！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYt7eUzxc9cwGaKc6SJ_1yIwn71.png"></figure>]]></description>
