  <item>
    <title>数据洞察绿色收益￤与电力数据分析师的盈利回忆杀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6624d12c200abebe6e3d91fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6624d12c200abebe6e3d91fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Apr 2024 08:41:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;很荣幸邀请到了一位在电动汽车领域取得显著成就的低调数据分析师。他不仅在能源互联网的数据分析领域积累了丰富的经验，更在新能源市场帮助老板提前判别数据背后的盈亏动向。当然，我们之前是同一家公司的，今天就是一波回忆杀。通过他的视角，我们将一探究竟，彼此的工作如何转化为真金白银。无论您是对</span><strong><span>绿电交易、绿证交易、充电桩数据</span></strong><span>充满好奇，还是寻求在这一领域实现财务增长，这期播客都将为您提供宝贵的洞见。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务微信: cangzheli</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 山姆和小师太回忆杀的缘由&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 和山姆的不一致印象的遇见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> &nbsp;小师太的忙碌工作状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 绿证是什么，全球温室气体减排的缘由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 国际绿证、国内3大绿证</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 绿色电力证书的概念、怎么产生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoPzIXHbkUTYhoca-ok7zU1IDZfF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 买绿证得到的绿色电力证书交易凭证</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fubbd8jDpnBWxG7BuyqQe5OMlbhH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> 买电的时候有的绿色电力消费凭证</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnP-80CQpmpF8R9ES69aYYQvDS9_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 中国3大绿证 总结！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 绿证和碳配额的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 小师太经常出差去找光伏的余电上网做绿电交易</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 小师太浅谈近期热门的储能（投资储能的方式 + 虚拟电厂/辅助服务）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> 小师太的社交货币与财富增长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">33:42</a> 山姆在充电汽车后台做数据分析师的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2174">36:14</a> 深圳电力汽车充电数据的冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 数据分析师和营销团队的分工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a> 山姆给电力数据分析师的建议与岗位吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2756">45:56</a> 山姆在供电局中的配电网设计生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">46:43</a> 山姆浅谈国家电网的需求/市场情况</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8DkzErCn2XGZnLVZdvUuSemrUQ.png"></figure>]]></description>
